Id: dbs009f
Severity: FAIL
Category: services
Check: check_databases
Fix: Set a requirepass (and password every ACL user), bind localhost, and leave protected-mode on.
References: redis-server(1)

Redis is open to the network without a password: protected-mode is
off, no password is set, and it listens past localhost. Anyone
reaching it reads and writes every key; this exact shape is how
cryptominers move in.
